# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
title    Abyss
composer Claude
about    Black glass islands over nothing at all: very slow and sparse, a choir singing half notes over minor chords a tritone apart (Em and Bbm, Cm and F#m) on a low E that never moves, a bell tolling each bar and a music box that can't remember its tune. When something is near, a heartbeat, timpani, low toms and far thunder take over; brass joins the fight, a gong and an organ come for a guardian.
tempo    60
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.7

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead drone pad toll musicbox
# mood treasure: pad musicbox wonder
# mood sense:    heart thunder timpani toms drone pad
# mood rise:     sense lead toll snare
# mood fight:    rise -toms -snare brass drive war crash
# mood boss:     fight -lead gong organ

voice lead     choir     vol=0.32 pan=-0.1 att=0.3 rel=0.8
voice drone    voices    vol=0.3  att=1.5 rel=2
voice pad      pad       vol=0.24 pan=0.25 center=G3 att=1 rel=1.5
voice toll     bell      vol=0.25 pan=-0.3 rev=0.8
voice musicbox musicbox  vol=0.25 pan=0.5  rev=0.8
voice wonder   celesta   vol=0.32 pan=-0.4 rev=0.8
voice heart    kick      vol=0.5
voice thunder  thunder   vol=0.2  pan=-0.2
voice timpani  timpani   vol=0.5  pan=-0.1
voice toms     tomlo     vol=0.4  pan=0.25
voice snare    snare     vol=0.3  pan=0.1
voice brass    brass     vol=0.43 pan=-0.25 gate=0.65 center=G3 att=0.018 rel=0.09 rev=0.22
voice crash    crash     vol=0.26  pan=0.2
voice gong     gong      vol=0.35 pan=-0.3
voice organ    pipe      vol=0.3  att=0.5 rel=1

# Combat-only motion: tight low ostinato and accented battle drums, at the same tempo.
voice drive    strings   vol=0.38 pan=0.3 gate=0.5 att=0.015 rel=0.08 rev=0.25
voice war      tommid    vol=0.52 pan=0.15 rev=0.25

# Em Bbm Em Bbm | Cm F#m Em B: the motif (E F# G B A) falls apart over the tritones
pattern A
lead     | E4------- F#4------- | F4--------------- | G4------- B4------- | A#4------- C#5------- |
lead     | C5------- G4------- | A4------- F#4------- | G4------- E4------- | D#4--------------- |
drone    | E2+B2--------------- | = | = | = |
